      "id": 177788,
      "name": "seesome",
      "username": "seesome",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-14T14:30:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Usual effing Dawn. &nbsp;I read the game intro and spotted Guise's warning about the Aurora (Thanks, G!), so made my initial card choices with that in mind. The game was rough going for a while, but then things settled down. &nbsp;I had flipped Dawn and was about to get her to flip back with mostly harmless Citizens in play and D at about 1/3 of her HP, but then a combo of a 2nd Aurora and two Return from the Graves wiped out my plans and had Citizens mowing down my heroes. &nbsp;Ah well, I'll try again later for Near Mint.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:01:50.861Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
