      "created_at": "2016-06-14T14:30:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A few suggestion I'm going to put in white text incase you want to avoid spoilers</p>\n<p><font color=\"#FFFFFF\">Play Gimmicky Character on the turn after Dawn plays Citizen Autumn to avoid Devastating Aurora. &nbsp; I would also ignore dealing damage to Dawn the first round since she is going to play Healing Light. &nbsp; Leave Citizen Battery alone. &nbsp; I'd also suggest using Adhesive Foam Grenade the first round</font></p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:01:50.933Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
