      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-14T14:30:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I wad doing OK until the Devastating Aurora Guise warned us about, and then I couldn't get my feet under me.</p><p>I got her down to about 30. Environment killed a citizen and flipped her.&nbsp; Zero Died.</p><p>I got some set up while trying to speed her flipping.&nbsp; Aurora.</p><p>She finally flipped back, and brought me from three heroes between 12 &amp; 20 hp to 2 heros with 1 &amp; 2 hp.</p><p>Cue ragequit.</p><p>Maybe my next attempt will work out better.</p>",
