      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-14T21:03:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So far only played once. Was doing really well and would have won the next round. Then the environment turned on me.  It wiped Dawn’s citizens causing her to flip and then took out citizens each time I managed to get 5 into play. Bunker was attempting a last stand but the second Aurora put a stop to that.</p>",
