      "created_at": "2016-06-14T21:55:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lost Absolute Zero to the drones in the environment, but I just kept playing as many Guise cards as possible and it turned out ok.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Like LewdDolphin, I had Barbarian, Reference and Kawaii! out in the last round and took Dawn down from about 30 HP to 0 by the end of Ra's turn.</p>",
