      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-15T03:13:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint! The only non-Dawn Citizen I actively targeted was Citizen Tears. &nbsp;Otherwise, Do All The Damage Right Now to Dawn (and ignoring everyone else) works well.</p><p>I normally love Subzero Atmosphere vs Dawn, but couldn't with Autumn out (and me not targetting her) and with AZ always lowest HP (because he was doing all the damage with Thermodynamics and FrostBound Drain.).</p><p>Finished after Citizen Blood came out I think (did not see Return with Dawn or 2nd Devastating Aurora).</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
