      "created_at": "2016-06-15T03:29:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;Played around the Devesating Aurora. &nbsp;Took out Tears, Summer, and later Dare, left the others. &nbsp;Pulled off a Blatant Reference + UYITG copying Ra's Imbued Fire and Solar Flare. &nbsp;Lost AZ on the last round, but he got a few good licks in while on a double Imbued Fire. &nbsp;Never flipped Dawn.</p>",
